@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title 11.3 Shop Manages Blog Posts - class diagram
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam wrapWidth 240
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 50
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #444444
  BackgroundColor<<View>> #EADCFF
  BackgroundColor<<Controller>> #D8F3DC
  BackgroundColor<<Service>> #DCECFF
  BackgroundColor<<Repository>> #FFF1C9
  BackgroundColor<<Entity>> #E0F3E7
  BackgroundColor<<External>> #FFE0E0
  BackgroundColor<<DTO>> #ECECEC
  BackgroundColor<<Scheduler>> #FFE8CC
}
hide empty members
hide circle

class View <<View>>

class ManagerBlogController <<Controller>> {
  list(shopId, currentUser, page): BlogResults
  create(shopId, currentUser, blog, images): 201 BlogResult
  update(shopId, id, currentUser, blog, images): BlogResult
  publish(shopId, id, currentUser): 204
  hide(shopId, id, currentUser): 204
}
class BlogService <<Service>> {
  listManaged(shopId, actor, page): BlogResults
  save(shopId, id, actor, input, images): BlogResult
  publish(shopId, id, actor)
  hide(shopId, id, actor)
  -owned(shopId, actor, write): Shop
  -validateImageFile(file)
  -readImages(json): List<String>
  -writeImages(images): String
}
class CloudinaryService <<Service>> {
  uploadBlogImage(bytes, filename, contentType): String
  -upload(bytes, filename, contentType, folder, errors): String
}
interface BlogRepository <<Repository>> {
  findByShopId(shopId, pageable): Page<Blog>
  findByIdAndShopId(id, shopId): Optional<Blog>
}
class ShopRepository <<Repository>> {
  findById(id): Optional<Shop>
}
interface ShopStaffRepository <<Repository>> {
  findByShopIdAndUserId(shopId, userId): Optional<ShopStaff>
}
class BlogInput <<DTO>> {
  title (not blank, max 255)
  content (not blank, max 50000)
  status: DRAFT or PUBLISHED
  retainedImages (max 10)
}
class BlogResult <<DTO>> {
  id
  shop: ShopSummary
  title
  content
  images
  status
  createdDate
  lastModifyDate
}
class BlogResults <<DTO>> {
  content
  page
  totalPages
  totalElements
}
class Blog <<Entity>> {
  id
  title
  content
  images (JSON array of URLs)
  status: BlogStatus
  createdBy
  lastModifyBy
}
class Shop <<Entity>> {
  id
  name
  status
}
class ShopStaff <<Entity>> {
  isActive
}
class User <<Entity>> {
  id
  role
  status
}
class CloudinaryApi <<External>> {
  POST https://api.cloudinary.com/v1_1/{cloud}/image/upload\nfolder: flowershop/blogs
}

View --> ManagerBlogController : GET /api/shop/mine/{shopId}/blogs?page\nPOST /api/shop/mine/{shopId}/blogs (multipart)\nPUT /api/shop/mine/{shopId}/blogs/{id} (multipart)\nPUT /api/shop/mine/{shopId}/blogs/{id}/publish\nDELETE /api/shop/mine/{shopId}/blogs/{id} (hides the post)
ManagerBlogController --> BlogService
ManagerBlogController ..> BlogInput : reads part "blog"
ManagerBlogController ..> BlogResult : returns
BlogService ..> BlogResults : returns
BlogService --> BlogRepository
BlogService --> ShopRepository
BlogService --> ShopStaffRepository
BlogService --> CloudinaryService
CloudinaryService --> CloudinaryApi : upload image
BlogRepository ..> Blog
ShopRepository ..> Shop
ShopStaffRepository ..> ShopStaff
Blog "*" --> "1" Shop
ShopStaff "*" --> "1" Shop
ShopStaff "*" --> "1" User : user
Shop "*" --> "1" User : owner

note bottom of BlogService
  Read: owner or ACTIVE staff of the shop (else 404 "Không tìm thấy bài viết.").
  Write (create, update, publish, hide): shop must be ACTIVE, owner role SHOP and owner ACTIVE
  (else 403 "Shop phải được duyệt và đang hoạt động để đăng bài.").
  status HIDDEN in save is refused (400): use the hide action.
  Images: at most 10 per post (kept + new), each at most 5 MB, JPEG, PNG or WebP only.
  Update: kept images must already belong to the post (else 400).
end note

note bottom of BlogService
  "Delete" is a soft hide: status becomes HIDDEN, the row and the Cloudinary images stay.
  CloudinaryService has no delete call, so an image removed from a post stays on Cloudinary.
  ShopStaffRepository is injected by field (@Autowired), not by the constructor.
end note

note bottom of View
  Staff (SHOP_STAFF) can list, write, publish and hide if the shop is ACTIVE.
  Public visibility: status PUBLISHED and shop ACTIVE (see 11.2).
end note

@enduml
